 "_about": "Measured with 19.5 (console, batch) on sysuse auto (lo = price - 1000, hi = price + 1000): each graph is drawn with nodraw and each layer's p#-styled plot -- for a ci fit (lfitci, qfitci, lpolyci, fpfitci), which draws two plots, its band (pstyle ci) then its line, the line -- is read from .Graph.plotregion1.plot<k>.style.stylename (p<n> or p<n>line; p0 is drawn as p1).  twoway_lfitci_parse.class gives the line seriesid(-1), so a layer that is plot n of the graph draws in p((n-1) mod 15 + 1), and a ci layer whose line is plot n in p(((n-1) mod 15 + 1) - 1), p1 where that is 0.  'layers' are dash's plot entries; 'pstyle' is the 1-based p# of each layer.  z1 is #include s2color, linewidth p1 vthick, p14 thick, p15 vvthick.  'styles' is each listed layer's stylename; a layer whose style is not a p# (histogram's own 'histogram') is given the p# of its plot number in the fifteen-plot cycle.",
